Cell["\<\
The first GPU evaluation starts a worker process that keeps the GPU open for \
the rest of the Wolfram Language session, and later evaluations and session \
verbs use the same worker.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->448336599,ExpressionUUID->"5708d032-2150-04f2-7d37-ca7c50e56ed8"],

Cell["The same results on both devices", "Section",
 CellID->970785311,ExpressionUUID->"3b7807e8-9504-b25a-6907-9eb21cb600a0"],

